,title,link,text,language,family
0,Kulina language (Panoan) - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kulina_language_(Panoan),"Kulina or Kulina Pano is an obsolescent Panoan language of Javari River valley, Brazil.From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. Endangered Panoan language of Brazil. Not to be confused with Olivença Kulina language or Kulina language.",Kulina Pano,Panoan
1,Kulina Pano,https://lingweb.eva.mpg.de/channumerals/Kulina-Pano.htm,"Kulina of the Olivença is an extinct Panoan language once spoken in Brazil along the Amazon River near the town of São Paulo de Olivença, documented by Johann von Spix in 1820 and published in the following book: Martius, Carl Friedrich Phil. von.",Kulina Pano,Panoan
2,Kulina – UNIVAJA,https://univaja.org/kulina/,"Mesmo enfrentando um passado de violência, guerras com outros povos e constantes invasões, seguimos em frente. Nós, povo Kulina Pano, resistimos aos desafios históricos e nos fortalecemos com a sabedoria de nossos anciões e o espírito coletivo que une nossa gente.",Kulina Pano,Panoan
3,"Aldizo Tuffh – KULINA (Pain, Roots & Reality) Official Audio ...Kulina Pano - Max Planck SocietyCuruça Kulina language - WikiwandTEDE: Os Kulina-Pano do Vale do Javari: histórias, memórias e ...",https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0giP_bnRJCI,"KULINA is a voice of the people, a song that even a child can sing, just like the songs of our ancestors that continue through generations. With powerful melodies and real-life storytelling,... Note on homophony: “Kulina-Pano” is a problematic term in that there are actually two languages called Kulina in the Panoan family (in addition to the Kulina language in the Arawan family). Kulino or Kulina Pano is an obsolescent Panoan language of Javari River valley, Brazil. The Kulina Pano people live in the village of Aldeia Pedro Lopes on the middle stretch of the Curuçá River in Amazonas. Esta dissertação é resultado de um estudo interdisciplinar que enfocou as próprias narrativas Kulina-Pano a respeito dos seus processos históricos, por eles vivenciados e como esses processos influenciaram nas suas relações interétnicas.",Kulina Pano,Panoan
4,Curuça Kulina language - Wikiwand,https://www.wikiwand.com/en/articles/Kapishto_language,"Kulino or Kulina Pano is an obsolescent Panoan language of Javari River valley, Brazil. The Kulina Pano people live in the village of Aldeia Pedro Lopes on the middle stretch of the Curuçá River in Amazonas.",Kulina Pano,Panoan
5,"TEDE: Os Kulina-Pano do Vale do Javari: histórias, memórias e ...",https://tede.ufam.edu.br/handle/tede/6455,"Esta dissertação é resultado de um estudo interdisciplinar que enfocou as próprias narrativas Kulina-Pano a respeito dos seus processos históricos, por eles vivenciados e como esses processos influenciaram nas suas relações interétnicas.",Kulina Pano,Panoan
6,Kulina Pano in Brazil people group profile | Joshua Project,https://joshuaproject.net/people_groups/21571/BR,"The Kulina Pano tribe live in the southwestern part of Brazil’s rainforest, mostly in the state of Acre. Their language is Kulina and it’s part of the Panoan family of languages.",Kulina Pano,Panoan
7,Panoan | Ethnologue Free,https://www.ethnologue.com/subgroup/330,"Panoan. Subgroup of 27 languages.Cashibo 1. Kakataibo-Kashibo cbr, a language of Peru. Pano 1.",Kulina Pano,Panoan
8,Glottolog 5.3 - Kulina Pano,https://glottolog.org/resource/languoid/id/kuli1255,"Panoan (38). Mainline Pano (30). Comment: Kulina (1734-xpk) = Severely Endangered (20 percent certain, based on the evidence available) [Fleck 2010](cldf:fleck:10). Glottocode: kuli1255. ISO 639-3: xpk.",Kulina Pano,Panoan
